y":"This causes 50% of the page renderings to be useless. It's confusing that revalidate: 60 means on a fetch calls means your page will update it's data every 2 minutes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1826397347/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"hallatore","id":365605,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTYwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/365605?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore","html_url":"https://github.com/hallatore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1826408844","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/58909#issuecomment-1826408844","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/58909","id":1826408844,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5s3MmM","user":{"login":"hallatore","id":365605,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTYwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/365605?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore","html_url":"https://github.com/hallatore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-25T19:57:36Z","updated_at":"2023-11-25T19:57:36Z","body":"I tested a bit more locally. Finding this bug to be quite strange.\r\n\r\n- If I refresh multiple times per second, then the time is only updated every 10+ seconds.\r\n- If I refresh slower, like every 2 seconds, I sometimes get a new time after 5+ seconds.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1826408844/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"hallatore","id":365605,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTYwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/365605?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore","html_url":"https://github.com/hallatore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1826416281","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/58909#issuecomment-1826416281","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/58909","id":1826416281,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5s3OaZ","user":{"login":"hallatore","id":365605,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTYwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/365605?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore","html_url":"https://github.com/hallatore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-25T20:43:26Z","updated_at":"2023-11-25T20:43:26Z","body":"I think I tracked it down to a race condition somewhere in the code.\r\nIf I add a 100ms delay to the start of my function, then the fetch call always return fresh data.\r\n\r\nExample video. Second half is with 100ms delay added to start of function.\r\nhttps://github.com/vercel/next.js/assets/365605/8ef92e43-fdb3-4f0c-91a3-cb87f6dacb8e\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nExample code where it now seems to work:\r\n```\r\nasync function Page() {\r\n  await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 100));\r\n  const response = await fetch(\r\n    \"http://worldtimeapi.org/api/timezone/Europe/Oslo\",\r\n    {\r\n      next: {\r\n        revalidate: 5,\r\n      },\r\n    }\r\n  );\r\n\r\n  const json = (await response.json()) as { datetime: string };\r\n\r\n  // Note: function is run twice for some reason. This is a different bug: https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/58736\r\n  console.log(\"local\", new Date().toLocaleTimeString());\r\n  console.log(\"fetch\", json.datetime.substring(11, 19));\r\n  console.log(\"\");\r\n\r\n  return (\r\n    <div>\r\n      <h1>Time should update every 5 seconds. Not every 10.</h1>\r\n      <p>local: {new Date().toLocaleTimeString()}</p>\r\n      <p>fetch: {json.datetime.substring(11, 19)}</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  );\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport default Page;\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1826416281/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"hallatore","id":365605,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTYwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/365605?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore","html_url":"https://github.com/hallatore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1826428229","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/58909#issuecomment-1826428229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/58909","id":1826428229,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5s3RVF","user":{"login":"hallatore","id":365605,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTYwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/365605?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore","html_url":"https://github.com/hallatore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-25T21:57:56Z","updated_at":"2023-11-25T21:57:56Z","body":"I also found that this bug also happens if the page has a revalidate and the fetch has nothing.\r\n\r\nUncomment the await at the top of the function magically fixes the bug\r\n```\r\nexport const revalidate = 5;\r\n\r\nasync function Page() {\r\n  // Note: Uncomment this to \"fix the bug\"\r\n  //await new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, 100));\r\n\r\n  const response = await fetch(\r\n    \"http://worldtimeapi.org/api/timezone/Europe/Oslo\"\r\n  );\r\n\r\n  const json = (await response.json()) as { datetime: string };\r\n\r\n  return (\r\n    <div>\r\n      <h1>Time should update every {revalidate} seconds.</h1>\r\n      <p>local: {new Date().toLocaleTimeString()}</p>\r\n      <p>fetch: {json.datetime.substring(11, 19)}</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  );\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport default Page;\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1826428229/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"hallatore","id":365605,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTYwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/365605?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore","html_url":"https://github.com/hallatore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1826747196","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/58909#issuecomment-1826747196","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/58909","id":1826747196,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5s4fM8","user":{"login":"hallatore","id":365605,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTYwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/365605?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore","html_url":"https://github.com/hallatore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hallatore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-26T10:36:11Z","updated_at":"2023-11-26T10:36:11Z","body":"Turned on `NEXT_PRIVATE_DEBUG_CACHE = true` in .env.local and got the following output.\r\nNotice the first one sets the fetch call before the page-function is run. the second one doesn't set fetch at all.\r\n\r\n```\r\n// output when it works\r\nusing filesystem cache handler\r\nnot using memory store for fetch cache\r\nget /index undefined app true\r\nget 03c3d5ae7e21018aa8db4b0559be1e18e9f2e94e9dc15d94e7360c6345b0fd3b [] fetch true\r\nset 03c3d5ae7e21018aa8db4b0559be1e18e9f2e94e9dc15d94e7360c6345b0fd3b\r\nlocal 11:27:59\r\nfetch 11:28:00\r\nset /index\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n// output where fetch uses state data\r\nusing filesystem cache handler\r\nnot using memory store for fetch cache\r\nget /index undefined app true\r\nget 03c3d5ae7e21018aa8db4b0559be1e18e9f2e94e9dc15d94e7360c6345b0fd3b [] fetch true\r\nlocal 11:28:04\r\nfetch 11:28:00\r\nset /index\r\n``` ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1826747196/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"hallatore","id":365605,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NTYwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co